    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n75940" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρά̆νο-θῐ</span></b> , Adv.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>in heaven, in the heavens</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρανόθι πρό</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					3.3
				</span></i>
			, expld. by Sch.A as 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῷ ὑπὸ τὰ νέφη
				τόπῳ</span>
			 (like <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἰλιόθι πρό</span> or
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἠῶθι πρό</span>); 
				v.l.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐρανόθεν</span>
			.</div>
